    m_Localized: PATH TOTAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1720781938614278
    m_Localized: NEW!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1720781938614279
    m_Localized: BADGES UNLOCKED THIS RUN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1720781942808576
    m_Localized: "TAP \xB7 GET COINS"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1720781942808577
    m_Localized: PLAY AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1720781942808578
    m_Localized: CHANGE MODE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1720781942808579
    m_Localized: "NEXT LEVEL \xB7 {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1720781947002880
    m_Localized: TRY AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300676
    m_Localized: Instantly clears every block in the column you choose, whether or not that column was already full. Arm it by tapping its icon, then tap the column you want cleared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300675
    m_Localized: Column Clear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300674
    m_Localized: Instantly clears every block in the row you choose, whether or not that row was already full. Arm it by tapping its icon, then tap the row you want cleared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300673
    m_Localized: Row Clear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1869058130567171
    m_Localized: Hold pocket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1869058130567172
    m_Localized: "If you don't want to place a dock piece right now, drag it here to hold it for later. When you need it, drag it back out onto the board \u2014 the pocket holds only one piece at a time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300672
    m_Localized: Destroys every block in the 3x3 area centred on the cell you choose. Tap its icon to arm it, then tap anywhere on the board to detonate it there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479841329152
    m_Localized: Bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300677
    m_Localized: Joker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300678
    m_Localized: "Gives you a special single block that counts as any colour. Drag and place it like a normal piece \u2014 any row or column it completes clears instantly."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300679
    m_Localized: Colour Cleanser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300680
    m_Localized: "Lets you pick one of the colours currently on the board \u2014 every block of that colour disappears at once, wherever it sits."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300681
    m_Localized: Rotate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300682
    m_Localized: Choose one of your dock pieces and rotate it 90 degrees before placing it, so it fits the board better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300683
    m_Localized: Reroll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300684
    m_Localized: If none of your current dock pieces are useful, this swaps all three for a fresh, random set in one go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300685
    m_Localized: 2x Multiplier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300686
    m_Localized: "Once activated, every point you score is doubled for a limited window \u2014 time it for your biggest scoring moves."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300687
    m_Localized: Ghost Fit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300688
    m_Localized: "Pick one of your dock pieces and it highlights the best spot for it on the board as a ghostly outline \u2014 just drag the piece there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300689
    m_Localized: Coin Sower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300690
    m_Localized: Scatters coin icons across random cells on the board. Clear those cells by completing their row or column to collect the coins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300691
    m_Localized: Explosive Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300692
    m_Localized: When a line clear destroys this cell, it also blasts the cells right around it, kicking off a chain of extra clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300693
    m_Localized: Laser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300694
    m_Localized: The instant this cell is destroyed, it wipes its entire row and column from edge to edge, full or not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300695
    m_Localized: Vortex
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300696
    m_Localized: Slowly pulls the filled cells around it toward its own centre. Place a piece directly on it to destroy it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300697
    m_Localized: Chain Lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300698
    m_Localized: "When destroyed, it jumps to any special cells nearby and triggers them early too \u2014 it can set off a whole chain of special cells."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300699
    m_Localized: Score Gem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300700
    m_Localized: When a line clear destroys this cell, you earn bonus points on top of the normal score for that clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300701
    m_Localized: Coin Cell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300702
    m_Localized: Destroy this cell by clearing its row or column and you automatically earn a coin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300703
    m_Localized: Golden Piece
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300704
    m_Localized: "Added to your dock when you land a five-move combo streak of line clears. It plays exactly like an ordinary single block \u2014 it's purely a visual reward for the streak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300705
    m_Localized: Piercing Rocket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479862300706
    m_Localized: Added to your dock when a single placement clears three or more lines at once. When you place this piece, it wipes the entire row and column of the cell it lands on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479866494976
    m_Localized: Demolition Hammer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1892479866494977
    m_Localized: "Given to you as a last resort when the board is nearly full and nothing fits. It isn't dragged \u2014 tap its icon to arm it, then tap the single cell you want to destroy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2010649772154880
    m_Localized: Multi-Line Clear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
